8. Create File System

Run:

sudo mkfs -t ext4 /dev/xvdf
9. Create Mount Directory

Run:

sudo mkdir /data
10. Mount EBS Volume

Run:

sudo mount /dev/xvdf /data
11. Verify Mount

Run:

df -h

You should see:

/dev/xvdf mounted on /data
12. Store Sample Data
